    "title": "SEC Charges Two Companies in $130 Million Crypto Trading Scheme",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/sec-charges-companies-130-million-crypto",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/SEC-Charges-Two-Companies-in-130-Million-Crypto-Trading-Scheme.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/sec-charges-companies-130-million-crypto\" rel=\"nofollow\">SEC Charges Two Companies in $130 Million Crypto Trading Scheme</a></p>\n<p>The SEC has charged two companies with defrauding investors of over $130 million through a crypto Ponzi-like scheme.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/sec-charges-companies-130-million-crypto\" rel=\"nofollow\">SEC Charges Two Companies in $130 Million Crypto Trading Scheme</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/SEC-Charges-Two-Companies-in-130-Million-Crypto-Trading-Scheme.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/sec-charges-companies-130-million-crypto\" rel=\"nofollow\">SEC Charges Two Companies in $130 Million Crypto Trading Scheme</a></p>\n<p>The SEC has charged two companies with defrauding investors of over $130 million through a crypto Ponzi-like scheme.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/sec-charges-companies-130-million-crypto\" rel=\"nofollow\">SEC Charges Two Companies in $130 Million Crypto Trading Scheme</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
