    "title": "Blockchain Firms Link North Korea to $6.3 Billion Binance Hack",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/north-korea-6-3-billion-binance-hack",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Blockchain-Firms-Link-North-Korea-to-6.3-Billion-Binance-Hack-.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/north-korea-6-3-billion-binance-hack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blockchain Firms Link North Korea to $6.3 Billion Binance Hack </a></p>\n<p>Chainalysis and TRM Labs have linked yesterday’s $6.3 billion Binance hack to North Korea’s TraderTraitor group.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/north-korea-6-3-billion-binance-hack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blockchain Firms Link North Korea to $6.3 Billion Binance Hack </a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Blockchain-Firms-Link-North-Korea-to-6.3-Billion-Binance-Hack-.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/north-korea-6-3-billion-binance-hack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blockchain Firms Link North Korea to $6.3 Billion Binance Hack </a></p>\n<p>Chainalysis and TRM Labs have linked yesterday’s $6.3 billion Binance hack to North Korea’s TraderTraitor group.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/north-korea-6-3-billion-binance-hack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blockchain Firms Link North Korea to $6.3 Billion Binance Hack </a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
