    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WIE3b9y7jSI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/WIE3b9y7jSI/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Doomberg-US-Treasury-Sanctions-are-22Wildly-Bullish22-for-Bitcoin-Gold-.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/doomberg-us-treasury-sanctions-are-wildly-bullish-for-bitcoin-gold\" rel=\"nofollow\">Doomberg: US Treasury Sanctions are &#8220;Wildly Bullish&#8221; for Bitcoin &amp; Gold</a></p>\n<p>U.S. pressure to hold Treasuries forces central banks to sell what they can, says Doomberg, setting up a wildly bullish long-term case for gold and Bitcoin.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/doomberg-us-treasury-sanctions-are-wildly-bullish-for-bitcoin-gold\" rel=\"nofollow\">Doomberg: US Treasury Sanctions are &#8220;Wildly Bullish&#8221; for Bitcoin &amp; Gold</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
